WEBVTT

00:04:29.823 --> 00:04:35.109
But we must constantly grapple with who 
the “real” Hamlet might be.

00:04:35.109 --> 00:04:38.458
Is he a noble son avenging his father?

00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:41.718
Or a mad prince creating courtly chaos?

00:04:41.718 --> 00:04:44.798
Should he act or observe, doubt or trust?

00:04:44.798 --> 00:04:48.358
Who is he? Why is he here?

00:04:48.358 --> 00:04:52.358
And who’s out there– 
waiting in the dark?